      <span data-id="pg035_n0006">Asnj&#xeb;her&#xeb; nuk e kam par&#xeb; veten t&#xeb; pabarabart&#xeb; me shok&#xeb;t e shoqet, qofshin k&#xeb;ta djem, qofshin vajza.</span>
